{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude93 <strong>DRIVE \u2022 CHASE \u2022 ARREST</strong> \u2014 <i>Pursuit Rampage</i> puts you behind the wheel of an elite police interceptor where every siren blast can flip from white\u2011knuckle pursuit to nail\u2011biting bomb run in seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OPEN\u2011ROAD SANDBOX</strong> \ud83c\udf0d 5 regions: \ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Beach, \ud83c\udf06 City, \ud83c\udfdc\ufe0f Desert, \ud83c\udf32 Forest, \ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f Suburban<br>\u23f0 3 time / weather presets: \u2600\ufe0f Day, \ud83c\udf19 Night, \ud83c\udf27\ufe0f Rain<br>\ud83c\udfa8 15 visual styles\u2014day, night, and rain variants for each region</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong> \ud83c\udfaf <strong>Career</strong> \u2013 40 escalating missions: distance sprints, bomb threats, tactical roadblocks, suspect pursuits, and high\u2011risk van escorts<br>\ud83d\ude94 <strong>Chase</strong> \u2013 20 timer\u2011based tails; stay in range, land the PIT<br>\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Arrest</strong> \u2013 15 bumper\u2011to\u2011bumper takedowns for pure police drama<br>\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Infinite</strong> \u2013 Endless score\u2011attack highway where one crash ends the run<br>\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Speed Bomb</strong> \u2013 Keep speed above the threshold while the timer ticks toward zero</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Arcade\u2011tight handling: PIT maneuvers, breakable traffic \ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca5<br>\ud83d\ude93 8 unlockable police cars\u2014collect them all, drive them all<br>\ud83c\udfc6 16 Steam achievements, global leaderboards \ud83c\udf10\ud83e\udd47, and cloud saves \u2601\ufe0f</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bomb Buster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811720/35740588e316625f1c28e4e13f3097a1d3eda7c6.jpg"},{"name":"Road Block Rock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811720/e3e68555be9a96d669